DESCRIPTION:The Congregation's weekly Adult Forum offers a variety of gues
 t speakers\, presentations and discussions on a wide range of thought-pro
 voking topics\, including Biblical studies\, current social issues and th
 e work of mission agencies.\n\nThis week's speaker is Ben Haas\, Executiv
 e Director of the Religious Coalition for a Nonviolent Durham who will be
  presenting on the topic: "Neighbors on the Road from 'What Happened?': A
  Restorative Justice Parable"
