DESCRIPTION:The Congregation at Duke University Chapel offers Children's C
 hristian education classes for all ages from 9:45 - 10:45 a.m. in the low
 est level of the Divinity School Buildings. New participants are welcome 
 to attend at any time.\n\nWEE PRAISE: Infants and toddlers\, ages 0-3\, a
 long with parent(s) or caregiver(s)\, use Musikgarten's God's Children Si
 ng curriculum to sing\, play simple instruments\, dance\, pray\, explore\
 , discover\, and learn.  We gather in 0011 Westbrook.\n\nGODLY PLAY: Chil
 dren in preschool-5th grade meet in 0054 Langford to take part in a creat
 ive and imaginative approach to Christian nurture.\n\nYOUTH PROGRAM: The 
 Youth Sunday School group (grades 6-12) meets in Westbook 0015 each week.
   This spring the youth are considering how our Christian faith informs h
 ow we can address the issue of economic inequality in our communities.
DURATION:PT1H
