DESCRIPTION:Our Adult Bible Study will explore Eastertide in the Synoptic 
 Gospels and Acts. Each week we will take a look at the post-Easter story 
 in the final chapters of Matthew\, Mark\, and Luke\, and consider what th
 e beginning of Acts has to say to us about being the church as a post-Eas
 ter people. \n\nCo-led by our Congregation's Sr. Pastor Ryan Wilson and o
 ur Divinity School Intern\, Daniel Parham\, the class will meet in Westbr
 ook 0013 and by Zoom.\n\n\n\nApril 26: Mark 16\n\nMay 3: Luke 24\n\nMay 1
 0: No Bible Study or Worship (graduation weekend) \n\nMay 17: Acts 1 & 2
DURATION:PT1H
